---
import FillButton from "../FillButton.astro";
import GhostButton from "../GhostButton.astro";
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import placeholderImg from '../../assets/img/placeholder.jpg';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---

<section id="community" class="community-section gold__band">

    <div class="community-information">
        <h1>Unparalleled peer support and <em>technical community</em></h1>
        <div class="community-information__body">
            <p>
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Quisque dictum iaculis nisi quis lobortis. Fusce pulvinar bibendum maximus. Morbi dapibus, dolor in consequat vestibulum, velit justo rhoncus justo, commodo lacinia neque sem sed diam.
            </p>
            <p>
               Nullam vitae egestas sem. Duis semper est ligula, ac feugiat massa aliquam ut. Phasellus scelerisque, dolor sit amet viverra semper, eros tortor convallis purus, ultrices maximus mauris sapien vel erat. Fusce dapibus lacus sed est luctus accumsan vitae quis eros.
            </p>
            <div class="community-buttons">
                <a href={`${base}plan/mypath`}><FillButton>Tech Leaders</FillButton></a>
                <a href="#faculty-intro"><GhostButton variant="dark">Tech Advisory Board</GhostButton></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="community-image">
        <Image src={placeholderImg} alt="Placeholder photo" />
    </div>

</section>
